        "url": "https://d1xhvexl2i3ere.cloudfront.net/Resources/04/04_pencil1_tip.jpg",
        "text": "A breadboard is hive-like component used to quickly build and test electrical circuits. Every column of the mini-breadboard (a set of 5 compartments) is connected underneath by a metal surface. Circuit components (LEDs, wires, capacitors, resistors, etc..) that are inserted into compartments on the same column are instantly connected to each other. A separation slit divides the breadboard horizontally, separating it into two areas: UP - further from the user and DOWN - closer to the user.",
        "type": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     "width": 0.0,
